  "segments": [
    {
      "order": 1,
      "section_id": "01M0W30GA6XPJWK39QKARCR2CC",
      "beat": "Hook",
      "spoken": true,
      "reason": null,
      "source_text": "Your production system can describe where a run is. The question is whether every\npart of it describes the same place.",
      "source_text_sha256": "e7fdf7537eff4d40d646f481ba2ead4f5f7aa586faab3fa7be0c80b7275315f9",
      "audio_path": "media/draft-narration/segment-01.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "2310054da538c5d2e7750b8acc92306750a382e4cab53b80e3142649df14af81",
      "duration_seconds": 6.548042,
      "start_seconds": 0,
      "end_seconds": 6.548042,
      "request_digest": "822df53e2f2119e208868c2ba00c4b77f43b37da78d9d3ead395b221d2405f4b"
    },
    {
      "order": 2,
      "section_id": "01M0W30GA7EZYRZCDQKFH5JBK8",
      "beat": "Viewer Problem",
      "spoken": true,
      "reason": null,
      "source_text": "A production pipeline usually grows several ways to answer one question: what\nstage is this in? A gate engine says one thing, a UI tracker says another, a\ndurable status file says a third. Each looks reasonable alone. Together they let\nwork appear further along than the evidence supports.",
      "source_text_sha256": "fb2cd39f973a676d7c33ebef3b3820e03e5fa44873487d8ea81cf0d789ba60ee",
      "audio_path": "media/draft-narration/segment-02.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "94989a25f2802a7891112cd912165ed1b50b0b7a1abc5d19d0e7b6ca548773a4",
      "duration_seconds": 17.287271,
      "start_seconds": 6.548042,
      "end_seconds": 23.835313,
      "request_digest": "fa7bc9243e7a431da946561821c7d1bb6ba13206af16c20c294fbc8b56a1e341"
    },
    {
      "order": 3,
      "section_id": "01M0W30GA7H83X932A0NBZR4HZ",
      "beat": "The Point",
      "spoken": true,
      "reason": null,
      "source_text": "One authority answers that question. Everything else is a view of that answer.",
      "source_text_sha256": "2396a5c9e2b8f67c0931fade93011a8161e1ccf167f45013ad54e5402bf16eb9",
      "audio_path": "media/draft-narration/segment-03.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "231c8fa592285d9582fe7e68db29cb288ab1c47185b69eafa1c820d2d41b96c9",
      "duration_seconds": 4.493063,
      "start_seconds": 23.835313,
      "end_seconds": 28.328376,
      "request_digest": "3ec8b9dd9c87b006504ac0dfc24ab716435fc0e1af84fa342296e3680b20596d"
    },
    {
      "order": 4,
      "section_id": "01M0W30GA7F6Y1MN4MBTT2TS7X",
      "beat": "Evidence",
      "spoken": true,
      "reason": null,
      "source_text": "The research for this run cites three in-repository sources: the gate engine that\ndefines the fourteen canonical gates, the authority document that records which\nsurfaces are views rather than authorities, and a recorded proof artifact showing\na contradiction between a gate and a display being detected and closed. Those\ncitations are listed in source-support-map.md.",
      "source_text_sha256": "d0b32f5b2584e8541efa463d9b38fbaa6743af64e49890397eeff2b3ad5d04f7",
      "audio_path": "media/draft-narration/segment-04.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "db9445e5cecb6f5e4bbd2c18691939e9ccb5ab903f8401c9a5d329364a284bd0",
      "duration_seconds": 21.373979,
      "start_seconds": 28.328376,
      "end_seconds": 49.702355,
      "request_digest": "8fde97278ae49ad92d66d3ebf0a1c83218b56bd47b5c86b083a8ec3becba2b1b"
    },
    {
      "order": 5,
      "section_id": "01M0W30GA7AFTN0GSB5394G7MH",
      "beat": "What This Run Demonstrates",
      "spoken": true,
      "reason": null,
      "source_text": "This package run moved through real gates using real evidence. Where evidence was\nmissing, the gate held. Where a human decision was required, the run stopped and\nwaited for it. That behaviour is the subject of this script.",
      "source_text_sha256": "9a239e635d133b5f5e39dda51bef9c22454682d69ace0f4e385bd9d3613cd5ba",
      "audio_path": "media/draft-narration/segment-05.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "a41079fb6758350f3d61632205568fb4a2ef89f0f8ca2cd3ecf0755817b340aa",
      "duration_seconds": 13.026396,
      "start_seconds": 49.702355,
      "end_seconds": 62.728751,
      "request_digest": "2a6970d5ae6fd47dab2e08bf4cd20086ceef89c2e5fed14d347f0c56a5de2a89"
    },
    {
      "order": 6,
      "section_id": "01M0W30GA703JCAW3MAB7TNGZC",
      "beat": "Close",
      "spoken": true,
      "reason": null,
